  "text_outside_tables": [
    "DCT & DSG\nCOMPATIBILITY\nCHART\nSYNTHETIC DSG / DSG FLUID\nAn advanced lubricant designed to provide superior component protection and enhanced service reliability\nwhen used in wet dual clutch transmissions (DCT) & direct-shift gearboxes (DSG). Part #’s 0426\nAPPLICATION\nUse in DCT or DSG transmissions according to equipment manufacturer’s recommendations.\nDO NOT use in CVT, traditional step-shift transmissions or Nissan transmissions that require GTR fluid.\nMOC PRODUCTS, INC. ©2026"
